  "description": "Pack a high-impact urban punch, 90s street art vibe, and bold bubble-letter energy into your designs with Metro Punch! Marketed as a Shadowed Graffiti Display Font, Metro Punch constructs thick, hand-drawn graffiti characters backed by heavy solid drop shadows and crisp outer strokes. Its energetic street-style posture brings immediate urban attitude and retro pop power to display headers.  \nIdeal for streetwear apparel logos, skateboard graphics, urban event posters, music video titles, sticker pack designs, hip-hop album covers, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Pack a high-impact urban punch, 90s street art vibe, and bold bubble-letter energy into your designs with Metro Punch! Marketed as a Shadowed Graffiti Display Font, Metro Punch constructs thick, hand-drawn graffiti characters backed by heavy solid drop shadows and crisp outer strokes. Its energetic street-style posture brings immediate urban attitude and retro pop power to display headers.  </p>\n<p>Ideal for streetwear apparel logos, skateboard graphics, urban event posters, music video titles, sticker pack designs, hip-hop album covers, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!</p>",
